  "bodyHash": "e26c3d767ee664c6",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小骷髏</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">終於為我的世界加入了小骷髏！💀既然有小殭屍，為什麼不能有骷髏呢？普通骷髏、遠行者、沼澤骷髏、乾枯骷髏甚至凋零骷髏現在都可能以小變體形式生成，每個變體都有獨特的行為、攻擊方式和掉落物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可愛嗎？有時。無害？絕不可能。✨</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自然生成：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小骷髏變體有5%機率自然生成，如同小殭一樣。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px.,小骷髏：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\").使用弓箭在遠距離戰鬥，靠近時迅速切換成木劍進行近戰。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">❄️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小遠行者：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">投擲混合著石子的冰凍雪球，造成少量傷害並擊退目標。擊敗後可能掉落藍冰。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🍄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小沼澤骷髏：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">從遠處丟出蘑菇對敵人造成輕微傷害，同時提供獨特的蘑菇主題掉落物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏜️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小乾枯骷髏：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">向附近目標拋射沙塊，可作為方便的沙來源。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🖤 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小凋零骷髏：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">令人驚訝膽怯的生物，當你靠近會逃脫，害怕你搶走它所攜帶的凋零骷髏頭。擊敗後必定掉落頭顱，或者用凋零玫瑰與其交易。🌹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎁 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;獨特獎勵：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多種小骷髏變體提供特殊掉落物和替代資源獲取方式。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;必須在客戶端和服務器上安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;)(安裝於 FABRIC &amp; NEOFORGE)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;)(安裝於 FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;)(安裝於 FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果支援，可以透過遊戲內的模組選單直接進行設定（需在 Fabric 上安裝由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px.\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px.(由 Prospector 開發)）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span> ，檔名分別為 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span> 、<code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span> 或 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span> ，取決於設定類型。並非所有模塊都存在這些檔案類型。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/daveyx0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;Daveyx0</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;從其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/primitive-mobs\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;Primitive Mobs</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;模組的骷髏戰士獲得靈感，啟發了小骷髏的戰鬥行為。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/globox_z\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;Globox_Z</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;提供一些代碼，讓小骷髏背部能渲染物品，來自其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backslot\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;BackSlot</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/furgle\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;Furgle</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;從其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/baby-mobs\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;Baby Mobs</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;模組中獲得小凋零骷髏戴頭骨的靈感。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/effect-insights\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fast-item-frames\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/combat-nouveau\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
